cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the results it produces, please cite the paper."
title: "Velocity sorting biases the equilibrium in Array-RQMC for binary-collision models"
abstract: >-
  Companion code and data for a study of Array-RQMC applied to Kac-type
  binary-collision models, in which the particles of a system are ordered by
  their own state and that order chooses which particles collide.
